      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": "${datasource}",
          "expr": "(sum(increase(ollama_requests_total{job=\"ollama\",endpoint=~\"$endpoint\"}[24h]))) or vector(0 / 0)",
          "legendFormat": "Requests \u00b7 24h",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Estimated counter increase over 24 hours, selected endpoints, including removed models with retained counter history. Not the dashboard time-range total. Sparkline shows aggregate history across the selected range; the number is its latest evaluated sample. Missing samples remain Unknown, not a stale last-known value."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Current models by exporter",
      "description": "One row per current model and full scrape identity. Horizontal scroll keeps columns inside the panel; hover a cell and use its inspect icon for the full value. Extra scrape labels remain separate columns. Missing metrics are Unknown; zero is a measured value. Latest throughput is not concurrent aggregate throughput. Requests use selected endpoints and 24-hour counter increases; removed inventory rows are excluded. Configurable illustrative bands: VRAM zero / >0 / 4 GiB / 16 GiB; decode zero / 1 / 10 / 30 tok/s; prefill zero / 1 / 100 / 500 tok/s; requests zero / 1 / 100 / 1000 per 24h. VRAM and requests use blue intensity, not health severity. TPS bands are illustrative performance only; tune for model/hardware. Gray zero is a measured zero; gray Unknown is missing.",
